*** Begin ECU Patch
Key: 013-model-action-wire-names
Title: Preserve canonical action names over model-safe wire names
Purpose: Keep durable domain.actionName identity while satisfying provider tool-name constraints.

*** Begin Context
The Esolbay Azure gpt-5.6-sol deployment rejects dots and other characters outside its tool-name alphabet. Reactor now encodes only the model transport name, maps calls back to the canonical registered action, and preserves canonical names in durable Event Parts and replay.
*** End Context

